#: includes/class-help-admin.php:448
msgid "With memory, the briefing writes «Συνεχίζεται για τρίτη μέρα η απεργία των εκπαιδευτικών· σήμερα…» and spends its words on what is new. When the strike ends, the digest marks the story resolved and it fades out of later briefings."
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-help-admin.php:622
msgid "With the current budgets this task would receive nothing."
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-help-admin.php:394
msgid "With the fiche, the briefing writes «η υπουργός Εργασίας Μαρία Ιωάννου». If today she argues against something she supported last month, the AI can say she has changed position, with the earlier date, instead of presenting both as new."
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-help-admin.php:308
msgid "With the fiche, the same material comes out as «Σύμφωνα με την κυβέρνηση, η Βουλή καθυστερεί την αύξηση· η αντιπολίτευση απαντά ότι δεν έχει κατατεθεί νομοσχέδιο», with «έως 100 ευρώ» and who it applies to. In the QA gate, a draft that states the claim as fact gets a lower score and the feedback names the claim."
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-help-admin.php:226
msgid "With the sample agenda, the talks story moves up because its priority is 5, the text says at which stage the talks are, and statements are attributed («σύμφωνα με τον κυβερνητικό εκπρόσωπο»). Headlines stay descriptive because of the standing guidance. If there is no talks story in today's articles, nothing about the talks is added."
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-help-admin.php:447
msgid "Without memory, the third day of a strike is written like the first: «Οι εκπαιδευτικοί ανακοίνωσαν απεργία…», with all the background again."
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-help-admin.php:225
msgid "Without the agenda, the briefing orders the day's stories by what the articles stress most. A short statement on the Cyprus talks may sit in the middle, worded like the press release."
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-help-admin.php:307
msgid "Without the fiche, an article quoting the government that \"Parliament is blocking the pension increase\" can come out as «Η Βουλή μπλοκάρει την αύξηση των συντάξεων», in the newsroom's own voice, with \"100 euro\" and no limits."
